The email fixture, avatar images, theme colors, and visual layout originate from
the Android Reply sample. The Kotlin/Compose implementation has been adapted to
C#/Avalonia and Material3Expressive. Responsive layouts use ContainerQuery.
Search results filter the inbox directly. Mail actions operate on local memory.
The demonstration thread order is deterministic. Unimplemented destinations and
compose/reply actions are disabled. Theme selection is available in the avatar menu.
